.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aRsV8VCJ8KoQ7kNvwFRiTlv&_nc_oc=Adq9fDQWHo_TR8fQ59O2W1zFvOXLNwCs1_a-Qdn5rPHZSUMZYXeKkGkGgOBrsUKqPMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Oitf1saUozFuUaunlxkGerW8xWg8Uw-vqVnXSFC-Eww&oe=6A26D22A"}, {"file_name": "3-2.png", "id": "1284785776880342", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_1284785780213675_5284627700581499596_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a0oq5yAiVIwQ7kNvwHa47jJ&_nc_oc=Adrqx4ay2eW8HvXti9SApcQ-2gbT0ttzdGC4cmsJrR8yyaYzxjDhMXNNBkxx250tXUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8L383WfEuR_64_B7tWgvN7ju-_2eT6-W5V6maCeWWisQ&oe=6A26B8C9"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2484616118658242", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_2484616121991575_8648732292525837536_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=inVD5NI--F4Q7kNvwEHTjeE&_nc_oc=AdqW0sWC-r_0H6IvvZEAeVk254C0Op-jCBJO9VHkaAnMSJ1M4X5wAeQ3u4HoAfrdSlg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8faSLN_xHSen4qM0XloeYqFneiRNtELr0mbVx-cSFuMA&oe=6A26BBDC"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1380818957145355", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1380818960478688_6478677074990433939_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=igmdPn3zCkQQ7kNvwGLNZ35&_nc_oc=Ado3z0I_GPpyg2y-ItCOiH7HVxwG6_wbmlWdQmKEvjAWprF3xn7bbOs2yGWQnsJUhEM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-_ARBUDe9OW5U1Bq-_5Odon55Hn3Vcx8qtxBuYW_Vw5g&oe=6A26DABA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Celestia", "keywords": ["planetarium", "stellarium", "astronomy", "universe", "simulator"], "long_description": "Celestia \u2014 real-time 3D visualization of space\n\n3D Space Simulator | Celestia lets you explore our universe in three dimensions.\n\nCelestia simulates many different types of celestial objects. From planets and moons to star clusters and galaxies, you can visit every object in the expandable database and view it from any point in space and time. The position and movement of solar system objects is calculated accurately in real time at any rate desired.\n\nInteractive Planetarium | Celestia serves as a planetarium \u2013 for an observer on any celestial object.\n\nYou can easily navigate to any world and land on its surface. When used as a planetarium, Celestia shows accurate positions of solar system objects in the sky. You can switch labels and other supporting features on and off with hotkeys, or zoom in and out on an object of interest, for example Jupiter\u2019s system of moons.\n\nExpandable Content | Customize Celestia according to your needs.\n\nCelestia\u2019s catalogues can be easily expanded. There are many different add-ons available containing new objects like comets or stars, high-resolution textures of Earth and other well mapped solar system bodies, as well as 3D models for asteroids and spacecraft on precise trajectories. Even fictional objects from well-known sci-fi franchises can be found.", "short_description": "Celestia \u2014 real-time 3D visualization of space\n\n3D Space Simulator | Celestia lets you explore our universe in three dimensions.\n\nInteractive Planetarium | Celestia serves as a planetarium \u2013 for an observer on any celestial object.\n\nExpandable Content | Customize Celestia according to your needs."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://celestia.mobi/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Celestia Development Team", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://celestia.mobi/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "inter